{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1069", "sample_idx": 3, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "Subject: Invitation to Meeting on New Project Development\n\nDear Team Members\n\nI am writing to inform you that a meeting has been scheduled to discuss the new project that our company is undertaking. The meeting will take place on Friday at 2 PM in the conference room on the second floor of our office building. I expect all team members to be present at the meeting as it is crucial to the success of our project.\n\nThe new project is a significant undertaking for our company and it is expected to have a major impact on our business operations. Our research has shown that the success of this project is closely correlated with the level of collaboration among team members. Therefore it is essential that we all work together to achieve our goals.\n\nAs you are aware our company has been experiencing significant growth over the past year and this new project is a key part of our strategy to continue this growth. The project involves the development of a new product that will be launched in the market next quarter. Our marketing team has been working on the launch strategy and will be presenting their plan at the meeting.\n\nThe meeting will cover several important topics related to the project including the project timeline the budget and the roles and responsibilities of team members. We will also be discussing the resources required to complete the project successfully. I have asked our project manager to prepare a detailed report on the project status and this will be shared with all team members before the meeting.\n\nI expect all team members to come prepared to the meeting with their ideas and suggestions on how to move the project forward. We will be having a brainstorming session during the meeting where we will be discussing ways to overcome the challenges that we are likely to face during the project implementation.\n\nOur team has been experiencing some challenges in the past with regards to communication and collaboration. However I am confident that with the right approach we can overcome these challenges and deliver a successful project. I encourage all team members to be open and transparent during the meeting and to share their concerns and ideas freely.\n\nThe meeting will be a great opportunity for us to come together as a team and to discuss the project in detail. I am looking forward to seeing you all there and to working together to make this project a success. I am confident that with our collective efforts we can achieve great things and take our company to the next level.\n\nIn preparation for the meeting I request that you review the project report that will be shared with you and come prepared with your questions and comments. If you have any specific concerns or issues that you would like to raise during the meeting please let me know in advance so that I can add them to the agenda.\n\nI appreciate your cooperation and commitment to the success of this project. I am excited to work with all of you to make this project a reality and to achieve our business objectives.\n\nThank you for your attention to this matter and I look forward to seeing you all at the meeting.\n\nBest regards\nJohn Doe\nProject Sponsor", "logprobs": [{"token": "Subject", "logprob": -0.20141391456127167}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.0043597412295639515}, {"token": " Inv", "logprob": -0.010591013357043266}, {"token": "itation", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": " Meeting", "logprob": -0.0381779670715332}, {"token": " on", "logprob": -0.38929224014282227}, {"token": " New", "logprob": -1.922600269317627}, {"token": " Project", "logprob": -0.3151080310344696}, {"token": " Development", "logprob": -1.5824388265609741}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0001248043408850208}, {"token": "Dear", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Team", "logprob": -0.10646802186965942}, {"